  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open search",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Chats, tap the search button at the top. The first time, it opens with <strong>Channels</strong> and <strong>A–Z</strong> chosen.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9424e67ee0e044a9.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Find a room by name",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Type part of its name. Rooms you can join show below yours with <strong>Join</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3af8a1abd8e87491.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sort the list",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Recent</strong> for the latest chats first, or <strong>A–Z</strong> for names.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a6e8bf6bc6de0bc1.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Find a message",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Contents</strong> and type words from the message. It also finds older messages in every chat you are in.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c925af4e7678d500.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap a result to open its chat. Scroll up to find the message.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/423aeeb722dc2fb6.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Find a person",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Go back to Chats, open search again and tap <strong>People</strong>. Type a name or callsign, then tap the person to open or start a direct chat.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5afa8a4beeb2e8ed.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
